    "en": "Mining and Dwarves is an incremental game where you mine rocks, gather ore, and recruit dwarves. Play actively for maximum gains, or idle and let the dwarves do the work. Use your active abilities to maximize gains Recruit dwarves to mine rocks and gather ores Purchase upgrades to buff you and your dwarven helpers Idle and watch your dwarves work FEATURES Satisfying incremental progression. Vast skill tree to explore. 5 dwarf types. 8 unique player abilities. No prestige, just persistent progression."
